# oracle: cut-down examples/body/in.cubes: data.cubes replicated 2 2 2 (16 rounded cubes, edge 2, rounded diameter 0.5), velocity create 1.2 with dist gaussian mom yes rot yes, pair_style body/rounded/polyhedron 20 5 0 1 0.5 with pair_coeff * * 100 1 (the example's k_n, k_na, c_n, c_t, mu and A_ua), fix nve/body in place of the example's fix nvt/body (refused by the engine), 500 steps: thermo pe ke etotal press and the atom state
# Measured (engine vs native): thermo below 1e-12 (rel), per-atom state (x, v, f) max 1.1e-13 (fy of atom 7). Cut-down of examples/body/in.cubes: the example's fix nvt/body (refused by the engine) is replaced by fix nve/body, and the replicate is 2 2 2 (16 bodies) instead of 3 3 3 to stay within the case time.
# oracle-inputs: w121body_cubes_example.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-12
units           lj
dimension       3
atom_style      body rounded/polyhedron 1 8
read_data       w121body_cubes_example.data
replicate       2 2 2
velocity        all create 1.2 187287 dist gaussian mom yes rot yes
pair_style      body/rounded/polyhedron 20 5 0 1 0.5
pair_coeff      * * 100 1
comm_modify     vel yes
neighbor        0.5 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep        0.001
fix             1 all nve/body
thermo_style    custom step pe ke etotal press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          50
run             500
